  "description": "BIYBAO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H95 I20 O25 Yb5,6(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.459-4.917 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.80-158.26°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H95I20O25Yb5·(C7H8). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
